# Michigan State University

> The official Michigan State University web presence, powered by Sitecore XM Cloud. MSU is a public research university in East Lansing, Michigan, offering undergraduate, graduate, and professional programs across a wide range of disciplines.

This site delivers news, academic programs, events, people directories, and institutional content via a headless CMS architecture built on the Sitecore Content SDK for Next.js.

## Key pages

- [Home](https://msu.edu/): MSU main landing page

## Optional

- [Sitemap](https://msu.edu/sitemap.xml): Full XML sitemap for search engines

- [LLM Sitemap](https://msu.edu/sitemap-llm.xml): LLM-optimized sitemap for AI crawlers

- [Robots](https://msu.edu/robots.txt): Crawler and bot access rules

- [AI metadata](https://msu.edu/.well-known/ai.txt): AI crawler and LLM metadata (ai.txt)

